<name>Kariong Hieroglyphs</name><description>Dozens of Ancient Egyptian hieroglyph style characters carved into the sides of a sandstone cleft. While some argue these were left by stranded sailors thousands of years ago, most experts agree that these carvings are a product of the 20th century.</description><ExtendedData>
